	(text "J1: USB-C (USB 2.0 high-speed device, sink only) and ESD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a51d5bb8-aca4-5557-abd9-1a8b7341fac2")
	)
	(text "D+/D- joined at J1, then the 90R pair through U_ESD to the MCU (PA12/PA11): hand-routed on L1 over the\nL2 ground, no vias, no stubs, no test points (SPEC §7.1). VBUS: SMF5.0A TVS; <= 10 uF before U2.\nShield: 1M || 4.7n 1 kV to GND (proposal)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7818b0a4-5ccd-5f63-92f1-f5f7ab7e314b")
	)
	(text "U_CC: TUSB320LAI USB Type-C detect, I2C1 at 0x67 (owner's decision D3; the part a candidate)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd841960-1103-513c-ad17-b4e943180838")
	)
	(text "Rd on CC1/CC2 powered or not (dead-battery Rd 4.1-6.1k). PORT = GND: sink only. EN_N = GND: always on.\nADDR 4.7k to +3V3: I2C at 0x67 (low would be 0x47, INA226 +3V3_S4's). VBUS_DET 887k 1 % from VBUS.\nINT_N: 200k to +3V3, into U_EXP2 P14 (no MCU pin). Reads Default / 1.5 A / 3.0 A: the firmware's\nVSYS budget (SPEC §3.2, §8.4). R1/R2 5.1k Rd: NOT FITTED (they would halve U_CC's termination)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4adeeaea-af4c-5c1b-a5bc-613b1c3b73c4")
	)
